 divided by width. Thus area in (feet) 2 / width in feet = length in linear feet. 3) And to find width in linear feet, area will be divided by length.Thus area in (feet) 2 / length in feet = width in linear feet.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3815;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_11970";s:6:"answer";s:102:"Ear infections, strep throat, pneumonia, traveler's diarrhea, and certain other intestinal infections.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3816;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_11971";s:6:"answer";s:291:"Titanium dioxide occurs in nature as the well-known minerals rutile, anatase and brookite, and additionally as two high pressure forms, a monoclinic baddeleyite-like form and an orthorhombic α-PbO2 -like form, both found recently at the Ries crater in Bavaria. It is used in food colouring.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3817;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_11971";s:6:"answer";s:19:"Used as a whitener.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3818;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_11972";s:6:"answer";s:9:"Singapore";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3819;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_11973";s:6:"answer";s:191:"It is an income replacement program that protects state employees and their families in the event of a disability or inability to perform the material and substantial duties of the state job.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3820;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_11974";s:6:"answer";s:158:"Bill Bowerman and Philip Knight founded the Nike as the company name of Blue Ribbon Sports on 25th January 1964. On 30th May 1978, Nike, Inc. became official.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3821;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_11975";s:6:"answer";s:114:"Minerals can contain anything (nearly), including Iron, Magnesium, Silicon, Oxygen, Fluorine, Carbon and Hydrogen.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3822;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_11976";s:6:"answer";s:104:"Depending on their orbital locations Uranus will be 