359:"A gene is a segment of DNA sequence which can fold in any orientation and hence will code for a particular protein. DNA molecule is a double helix structure formed by complementary base pairing of nucleotides.Proteins are formed by particular t-RNA and are synthesized in ribosomes.Proteins are required for various metabolic activities occurring in the body.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3907;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12051";s:6:"answer";s:89:"The Bios Urn is a fully biodegradable urn designed to convert you into a tree after life.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3908;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12052";s:6:"answer";s:9:"1-3 years";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3909;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12053";s:6:"answer";s:294:"The mitotic spindle is the macromolecular machine that segregates chromosomes to two daughter cells during mitosis. The major structural elements of the spindle are microtubule polymers, whose intrinsic polarity and dynamic properties are critical for bipolar spindle organization and function.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3910;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12054";s:6:"answer";s:12:"3 to 4 days.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3911;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12055";s:6:"answer";s:22:"Average around $180000";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3912;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12056";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3913;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12057";s:6:"answer";s:40:"Maximum pay  £56,901 , Average  $64,000";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3914;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12058";s:6:"answer";s:163:"Mitsubishi Group  is a group of autonomous Japanese multinational companies covering a range of businesses which share the Mitsubishi brand, trademark, and legacy.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:3915;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12059";s:6:"answer";s:273:"If you wish to rename the device, select the “ Edi