;s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4117;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12243";s:6:"answer";s:137:"Infiltration rates in unoccupied houses in Melbourne and found that background infiltration rates were 0.33 air exchanges per hour (ACH).";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4118;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12244";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4119;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12245";s:6:"answer";s:314:"IGMP snooping is the process of listening to Internet Group Management Protocol (IGMP) network traffic. The feature allows a network switch to listen in on the IGMP conversation between hosts and routers.By listening to these conversations the switch maintains a map of which links need which IP multicast streams.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4120;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12246";s:6:"answer";s:10:"2.0 to 3.0";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4121;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12247";s:6:"answer";s:58:"Mountains are also important as centres of crop diversity.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4122;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12247";s:6:"answer";s:332:"Mountains are important to us because they're a huge factor in our ecosystem na provides diverse fauna and flora, recreational activities amazing features etc.It also helps people who live on lowland as it blocks wild weather. Mountains also contain minerals, water, wood and timber,etc. Also important as centres of crop diversity.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4123;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12247";s:6:"answer";s:499:"The diversity of natural mountain species that is of value to humankind, both intrinsically and as a source of wild foods such as mushrooms, game and birds, and many other non-timber forest products. Mountains are also important as centres of crop diversity.The maintenance and expansion of mountain populations in many parts of the world have been made possible by the introduction of potatoes and maize from Latin America. The original precursors of wheat came from the mountains of the Near East.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4124;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12248";s:6:"answer";s:290:"The great characteristic of all revivals has been the authority of the preacher. There seemed to be something new, extra, and irresistible in what he declared on behalf of God. Authentic expository preaching is marked by three distinct characteristics: authority, reverence, and centrality.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4125;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12249";s:6:"answer";s:6:"$13.55";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4126;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12250";s:6:"answer";s:49:"On the island of Maui in the U.S. state of Hawai.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4127;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12251";s:6:"answer";s:29:"$110,000 to $130,000 per year";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4128;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12252";s:6:"answer";s:3:"$99";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4129;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12253";s:6:"answer";s:38:"Range from 150 dollar to 1 lakh dollar";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4130;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12254";s:6:"answer";s:50:"a member of the white, or Caucasian, races of men.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4131;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12255";s:6:"answer";s:12:"4 - 15 hours";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4132;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12256";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4133;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12257";s:6:"answer";s:22:"8 months and two years";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4134;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12259";s:6:"answer";s:21:"In less than 21 days.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4135;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12260";s:6:"answer";s:577:"As the speed of light is thought to be an absolute speed (it is not, but close enough) we use it and a time frame, usually a year, to describe how far things are away.The term is: Light Year (the distance light will travel in a year) roughly 6 trillion miles. Divide the total distance by the total time to get the average speed. Or, when you need the speed at a certain time, you can differentiate the fuction of distance(t) over time. This can be compared with dividing the distance (of a really really really short timespan) by the same really really really short timespan).";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4136;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12260";s:6:"answer";s:228:"The speed of light is about 186,000 miles or 300,000 kilometers per second. So, in one year light travels a distance of about 5,880,000,000,000 miles or 9,460,000,000,000 kilometers or 63,240 A.U.. This distance is 1 light-year.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4137;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12261";s:6:"answer";s:19:"Started at 8 weeks.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4138;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12262";s:6:"answer";s:15:"Red blood cells";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4139;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12263";s:6:"answer";s:73:"It is a high level professional work in the field of membership benefits.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4140;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12264";s:6:"answer";s:12:"14th century";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4141;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12265";s:6:"answer";s:64:"Ranging from -218.79 degrees Celsius to -182.96 degrees Celsius.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4142;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12266";s:6:"answer";s:6:"$6,500";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4143;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12267";s:6:"answer";s:18:"Relations R and S.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4144;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12268";s:6:"answer";s:9:"Thylakoid";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4145;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12269";s:6:"answer";s:84:"Granuloma Inguinale, Klebsiel