ays.Freeze cooked lentils for 1-2 months. Dried lentils that have been cooked can be kept covered in the fridge for 5-7 days or frozen for up to 6 months.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4625;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12706";s:6:"answer";s:103:"First-wave feminism was a period of activity during the nineteenth century and early twentieth century.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4626;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12707";s:6:"answer";s:34:"Millions of nerve and glial cells.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4627;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12707";s:6:"answer";s:22:"Brain and spinal cord.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4628;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12708";s:6:"answer";s:7:"$54,000";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4629;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12709";s:6:"answer";s:6:"$2,500";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4630;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12711";s:6:"answer";s:19:"In the city of Pisa";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4631;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12712";s:6:"answer";s:26:"In The Warner Bros. Studio";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4632;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12713";s:6:"answer";s:31:"Andrew Johnson and Bill Clinton";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4633;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12714";s:6:"answer";s:13:"July 1, 1997.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4634;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12715";s:6:"answer";s:139:"(a) magmatic ore deposits, (b) hydrothermal ore deposits, (c) sedimentary ore deposits, (d) residual ore deposits, (e) placer ore deposits.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4635;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12717";s:6:"answer";s:7:"300°F.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4636;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12718";s:6:"answer";s:20:"Nourished by jupiter";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4637;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12719";s:6:"answer";s:768:"Determine what your paydays will be throughout the year. Often, employees who receive bimonthly paychecks have paydays on days 1 and 16 of each month. Add your anticipated paydays for the entire year. For example, if you receive pay on days 1 and 16, you have 24 paydays each calendar year.Divide your annual salary by the number of paydays each year to calculate your bimonthly salary. For example, if the annual salary is $56,000 and you have 24 paydays each year, divide $56,000/24 = $2,333.33.You bimonthly income will be $2,333.33.ften, employees who receive bimonthly paychecks have paydays on days 1 and 16 of each month. Add your anticipated paydays for the entire year. For example, if you receive pay on days 1 and 16, you have 24 paydays each calendar year.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4638;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12720";s:6:"answer";s:14:"Atlantic Ocean";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4639;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12721";s:6:"answer";s:157:"1 Bathe in the morning to reduce egg contamination. 2 Change and wash the patient's underwear everyday. 3 Also frequent changing of sleepwear is recommended.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4640;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12723";s:6:"answer";s:4:"3.65";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4641;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12724";s:6:"answer";s:2:"No";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4642;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12725";s:6:"answer";s:71:"2 1/2 to 3 hours for spare ribs or 1 1/2 to 2 hours for baby back ribs.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4643;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12726";s:6:"answer";s:3:"$29";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4644;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12727";s:6:"answer";s:128:"Digoxin is considered safe to use in the elderly as long as the dose is no greater than 0.125 milligram (mg) or 125 mcg per day.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4645;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12728";s:6:"answer";s:14:"20 to 25 years";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"lab