ing a price ceiling.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4832;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12900";s:6:"answer";s:62:"It maintains the critical missile defense mission in the area.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4833;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12901";s:6:"answer";s:210:"To calculate the gross profit, we first add up the cost of goods sold: Automotive cost of sales ($123,516 m) + FS interest expenses ($2,699 m) + FS provision for credit and insurance loss ($305 m) = $126,520 m.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4834;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12902";s:6:"answer";s:13:"29 March 1974";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4835;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12902";s:6:"answer";s:16:"Shaanxi province";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:4836;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_12903";s:6:"answer";s:282:"1 Put cool, moist washcloths on the rash. 
