:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14034";s:6:"answer";s:565:"Regardless of the amount, or if there is a cost of living increase for all employees, there is a standard way to calculate the increase. Step 1. Determine the yearly salary before the increase. This is the annual gross figure the employee received prior to the raise; for example, $50,000.Step 2. Compute the raise based on the percentage or the flat amount given. Percentage example: $50,000 x 4 percent (.04) = $2,000 annual increase.Therefore, the new annual salary is $52,000. The flat amount example would be: $50,000 + $1,500 = $51,500, the new annual salary.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6270;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14035";s:6:"answer";s:27:"Mitochondria and Glycolysis";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6271;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14036";s:6:"answer";s:100:"An important tool in managing your treatment plan and preventing long-term complications of diabetes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6272;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14037";s:6:"answer";s:7:"Nucleus";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6273;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14038";s:6:"answer";s:16:"$85,545 per year";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6274;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14039";s:6:"answer";s:136:"The best way to protect furniture when moving is to consider its specifics and provide in time the right materials to use for the move. ";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6275;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14040";s:6:"answer";s:157:"That can help the environment are called decomposers. They are nature's recyclers. They return basic chemicals to the environment for living things to reuse.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6276;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14042";s:6:"answer";s:270:"Cryotherapy is the local or general use of low temperatures in medical therapy. Cryotherapy is used to treat a variety of benign and malignant tissue damage, medically called lesions. The term cryotherapy comes from the Greek cryo meaning cold, and therapy meaning cure.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6277;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14042";s:6:"answer";s:225:"Cryotherapy is the local or general use of low temperatures in medical therapy.Cryotherapy is used to treat a number of diseases and disorders, most especially skin conditions like warts, moles, skin tags and solar keratoses.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6278;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14043";s:6:"answer";s:3:"sp2";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6279;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14043";s:6:"answer";s:17:"sp2 hybridization";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6280;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14044";s:6:"answer";s:76:"They deal largely with fossils of this more strictly defined Animal Kingdom.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6281;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14045";s:6:"answer";s:319:"A premium pricing strategy involves setting the price of a product higher than similar products. This strategy is sometimes also called skim pricing because it is an attempt to “skim the cream” off the top of the market. premium pricing strategy involves setting the price of a product higher than similar products.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6282;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14046";s:6:"answer";s:124:"Quilting is the stitching that holds all three layers of a quilt together and it is also the act of creating those stitches.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6283;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14047";s:6:"answer";s:16:"November 4, 2014";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6284;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14048";s:6:"answer";s:156:"Pomace is the mixture of tomato peels, crushed seeds and small amounts of pulp that remains after the processing of the tomato for juice, paste and ketchup.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6285;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14049";s:6:"answer";s:15:"$1000 per month";s:8:"category