estion";s:11:"query_14659";s:6:"answer";s:48:"Discount department stores and warehouse stores.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6956;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14660";s:6:"answer";s:10:"Five years";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6957;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14661";s:6:"answer";s:157:"Cylindrical bundles of fibers (the axons of neurons), that emanate from the brain and spinal cord, and branch repeatedly to innervate every part of the body.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6958;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14662";s:6:"answer";s:58:"11 weeks before the beginning of the week your baby's due.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6959;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14663";s:6:"answer";s:189:"Campaign finance refers to all funds raised in order to promote candidates, political parties, or policies in elections, referendums, initiatives, party activities, and party organizations.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6960;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14664";s:6:"answer";s:30:"Organelle in eukaryotic cells.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6961;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14665";s:6:"answer";s:60:"Transfer of pollen from the anther to the stigma of a plant.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6962;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14667";s:6:"answer";s:321:"Place eggs in a large saucepan. Cover them with cool water by 1 inch. Slowly bring water to a boil over medium heat; when the water has reached a boil, cover and remove from heat. Let sit 12 minutes.Transfer eggs to a colander; place under cool running water to stop the cooking.Eggs can be peeled and served immediately.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6963;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14668";s:6:"answer";s:467:"Retained earnings is the percentage of net earnings not paid out as dividends, but retained by the company to be reinvested in its core business, or to pay debt.It is recorded under shareholders' equity on the balance sheet.The formula calculates retained earnings by adding net income to (or subtracting any net losses from) beginning retained earnings and subtracting any dividends paid to shareholders: Retained Earnings (RE) = Beginning RE + Net Income-Dividends.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6964;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14669";s:6:"answer";s:143:"A synergistic term combining the promotion and selling of goods and services with an increasingly interdependent and integrated global economy.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6965;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14670";s:6:"answer";s:107:"ENU, also known as N-ethyl-N - nitroso urea (chemical formula C 3 H 7 N 3 O 2), is a highly potent mutagen.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6966;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14671";s:6:"answer";s:29:"Hands, knees, hips, and spine";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6967;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14672";s:6:"answer";s:38:"Gastrin, secretin and cholecystokinin.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6968;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14673";s:6:"answer";s:7:"$90,259";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6969;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14674";s:6:"answer";s:71:"Most adults have a resting heart rate of 60-100 beats per minute (bpm).";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6970;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14675";s:6:"answer";s:669:"Arthritis is inflammation of the joints (the points where bones meet) in one or more areas of the body.Arthritis is very common but is not well understood. Actually, “arthritis” is not a single disease; it is an informal way of referring to joint pain or joint disease. There are more than 100 different types of arthritis and related conditions.People of all ages, sexes and races can and do have arthritis, and it is the leading cause of disability in America.steoarthritis is the most common type of arthritis. When the cartilage – the slick, cushioning surface on the ends of bones – wears away, bone rubs against bone, causing pain, swelling and stiffness.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6971;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14676";s:6:"answer";s:8:"26 miles";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6972;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14677";s:6:"answer";s:268:"It is a Spanish mission founded in 1772 by Father Junipero Junípero serra in the-present day city Of San Luis, Obispo. California named After Saint louis Of, anjou the bishop Of, toulouse the mission is the namesake of the city Of San Luis obispo And San Luis Obispo.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6973;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14678";s:6:"answer";s:14:"10 to 13 years";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6974;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14679";s:6:"answer";s:21:"About $60,000 a year.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6975;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14680";s:6:"answer";s:8:"$104.75.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6976;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14681";s:6:"answer";s:13:"Washington DC";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6977;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14682";s:6:"answer";s:29:"$31,616 to $78,861 per annum.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6978;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14682";s:6:"answer";s:56:"Average salary ranges from $31,616 to $78,861 per annum.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6979;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14683";s:6:"answer";s:185:"It is a contagious disease caused by a virus. It typically starts with a few days of fever, headache, muscle aches, tiredness, and loss of appetite, followed by swollen salivary glands.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6980;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14684";s:6:"answer";s:99:"It is a medical or scientific abbreviation for ethanol, the substance found in alcoholic beverages.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6981;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_14685";s:6:"answer";s:48:"The average salary for engineer jobs is $66,000.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:6982;