tic cat found in the western grasslands of North America, such as Montana, Colorado, New Mexico, Oklahoma and Texas.It also lives in Manitoba, Saskatchewan and Alberta in Canada, where it was previously extirpated.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7800;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15252";s:6:"answer";s:143:"The Helix Fossil is a fossil that Omanyte can be resurrected from. You can get the Helix Fossil in underground in Diamond, Pearl, and Platinum.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7801;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15252";s:6:"answer";s:112:"Take the Helix fossil to the Cinnabar Museum in blue. The Helix and Dome fossils first appeared in Pokemon blue.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7802;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15253";s:6:"answer";s:54:"It is an enzyme that is released by white blood cells.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7803;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15254";s:6:"answer";s:78:"It is cow's milk, peanuts, eggs, shellfish, tree nuts, wheat, rice, and fruit.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7804;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15255";s:6:"answer";s:98:"The second planet from the Sun and is the second brightest object in the night sky after the Moon.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7805;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15256";s:6:"answer";s:178:"Chromecast is a great device to use with friends: Open the YouTube app on multiple devices, have everyone add some videos to the queue, and you’ve got yourself a YouTube party.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7806;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15257";s:6:"answer";s:29:"On the West Coast of Tasmania";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7807;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15258";s:6:"answer";s:204:"The relative humidity in the incubator between setting and three days prior to hatching should remain at 58-60% or 84-86 degree F.When hatching, the humidity is increased to 65% relative humidity or more.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7808;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15259";s:6:"answer";s:157:"Vegetables (especially dark green leafy vegetables), fruits and fruit juices, nuts, beans, peas, dairy products, poultry and meat, eggs, seafood, and grains.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7809;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15260";s:6:"answer";s:124:"It is the branch of philosophy that involves systematizing, defending, and recommending concepts of right and wrong conduct.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7810;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15261";s:6:"answer";s:18:"Press CTRL+ALT+F. ";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7811;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15262";s:6:"answer";s:46:"It means that you control what the muscles do.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7812;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15263";s:6:"answer";s:165:"A gene is a stretch of DNA or RNA that determines a certain trait,Genes mutate and can take two or more alternative forms; an allele is one of these forms of a gene.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7813;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15263";s:6:"answer";s:123:"An allele is one of two or more versions of a gene. An individual inherits two alleles for each gene, one from each parent.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7814;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15264";s:6:"answer";s:148:"An absolute fast is normally defined as abstinence from all food and liquid for a defined period, usually a period of 24 hours, or a number of days.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7815;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15265";s:6:"answer";s:204:"Friendship between the United States and France and as a monument to political liberty in both nations, it has come to represent a broader vision of freedom and democracy and the promise of a better life.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7816;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15266";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7817;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15267";s:6:"answer";s:461:"Housed between two sheets of glass is the technology that allows flat screen TVs to work. Depending on the type of flat screen TV, the process can differ slightly. In a plasma TVs are cells that contain the gases xenon and neon as well as electrodes.There are two types of electrodes, display and address, that are arranged in a grid-like pattern on either side of the cells.n a LCD flat screen TV, tiny liquid-crystal-filled cells are between the glass sheets.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7818;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15268";s:6:"answer";s:112:"Latitude is an angle (defined below) which ranges from 0° at the Equator to 90° (North or South) at the poles.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7819;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15269";s:6:"answer";s:102:"It is placed percutaneously, establishing antegrade access to the kidney, ureter, and urinary bladder.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7820;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15269";s:6:"answer";s:292:"An antegrade percutaneous internal/external nephroureteral (PCNU) stent is placed percutaneously, establishing antegrade access to the kidney, ureter, and urinary bladder. A segment of the stent remains outside the patient from the flank, which can be capped or connected to gravity drainage.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7821;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15270";s:6:"answer";s:24:"Neurobehavioral disorder";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7822;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15271";s:6:"answer";s:10:"Leon River";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7823;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15272";s:6:"answer";s:85:"The nationwide median price of $769 will buy you 267.08 feet in local square footage.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7824;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15273";s:6:"answer";s:256:"A traditional food wrap from Mexico consisting of a tortilla flatbread that is filled with meat, cheese, vegetables, refried beans, and salsa. The shell may be a soft shell tortilla, which is folded or wrapped around the ingredients and served hot or cold.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7825;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15273";s:6:"answer";s:85:"Traditional mexican dish composed of a corn or wheat tortilla folded or rolled around";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7826;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15274";s:6:"answer";s:70:"Misdemeanor Battery is defined under Section 784.03, Florida Statutes.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7827;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15275";s:6:"answer";s:199:"It is a Political journalism organization based in Arlington County, Virginia, that covers the issues, ideas and personalities behind politics and policy in the United States and in the global arena.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7828;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15276";s:6:"answer";s:72:"In Canada, Chile, New Zealand, Greenland, Norway, Siberia, and Scotland.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7829;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15277";s:6:"answer";s:20:"communicable disease";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7830;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15278";s:6:"answer";s:214:"Supermax (short for: super-maximum security) is the name used to describe control-unit prisons, or units within prisons, which represent the most secure levels of custody in the prison systems of certain countries.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7831;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15279";s:6:"answer";s:129:"Cells of the nervous system, called nerve cells or neurons, are specialized to carry messages through an electrochemical process.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7832;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15279";s:6:"answer";s:27:"electrical excitable cell .";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7833;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15280";s:6:"answer";s:33:"The largest country in the world.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7834;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15281";s:6:"answer";s:56:"Average yearly salary for Guidance Counselor is $55,063.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7835;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15282";s:6:"answer";s:257:"The Fibrosure test is a blood test which measures several different naturally occurring substances in the blood which give an indirect indication of chronic liver inflammation and through a mathematical calculation this is converted to a score for fibrosis.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7836;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15283";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7837;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15284";s:6:"answer";s:235:"The most common causes are certain foods, medications, or infections. Insect bites and internal disease may also be responsible. The most common foods that cause hives are nuts, chocolate, fish, tomatoes, eggs, fresh berries, and milk.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7838;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15285";s:6:"answer";s:32:"It is from $110,000 to $255,000.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7839;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15286";s:6:"answer";s:40:"Shrimp, surimi, squid, mussels, octopus.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7840;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15287";s:6:"answer";s:120:"The adrenal glands don't make enough of a hormone called cortisol, or less often, a related hormone called aldosterone. ";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7841;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15288";s:6:"answer";s:107:"It softens the more it is used and washed, is extremely durable and lasts decades when cared for correctly.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7842;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15289";s:6:"answer";s:153:"The typical cost to install a card reader on a single door is $3,000 to $5,000, which includes the electric lock, the card reader and associated devices.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7843;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15290";s:6:"answer";s:131:"A meristem is the tissue in most plants containing undifferentiated cells, found in zones of the plant where growth can take place.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7844;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15290";s:6:"answer";s:308:"Meristematic cells give rise to various organs of the plant and keep the plant growing.hese secondary meristems are also known as lateral meristems because they are involved in lateral growth. At the meristem summit, there is a small group of slowly dividing cells, which is commonly called the central zone.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7845;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15291";s:6:"answer";s:278:"Movement of the lower jaw opens and closes the mouth and also allows for the chewing of food.The lower set of teeth in the mouth is rooted in the lower jaw.A snake is an elongate reptile of the suborder Serpentes. Like all reptiles, snakes are ectothermic and covered in scales.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7846;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15292";s:6:"answer";s:8:"$510,000";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7847;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15293";s:6:"answer";s:538:"They work on specific projects that have definite outcomes, are time limited and have to stay within a budget. These roles typically include: 1 planning what work needs to be done, when and who’s going to do it. 2 looking at the risks involved in a particular project and managing these risks.3 making sure the work is done to the right standard. making sure the project is running on time and to budget. 2 dealing with changes to the project as and when necessary. 3 making sure the project delivers the expected outcomes and benefits.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7848;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15294";s:6:"answer";s:361:"Viruses cause viral gastroenteritis, commonly called the stomach flu.. This common illness, characterized by diarrhea, nausea and vomiting, is caused by many different viruses, but not the influenza virus.According to a 2012 article in the journal American Family Physician, viruses cause between 75 and 90 percent of acute gastrointestinal disease in children.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7849;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15295";s:6:"answer";s:90:"A group of baby lynx is called a litter; individual cats in the litter are called kittens.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7850;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15296";s:6:"answer";s:8:"$124,065";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7851;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15297";s:6:"answer";s:343:"If the bottom side of your bath rub faucet spout is smooth, you have a twist-on spout. To remove it, insert the end of a large screwdriver into the spout from the bottom and carefully turn the spout counterclockwise to twist it off. a wrench to grasp and twist the pipe counterclockwise to free it from the plumbing connection within the wall.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7852;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15298";s:6:"answer";s:17:"Limited liability";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7853;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15299";s:6:"answer";s:159:"It is located on a 100-acre (0.40 km 2) site on the northern quay of the Royal Victoria Dock in London Docklands, between Canary Wharf and London City Airport.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7854;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15299";s:6:"answer";s:24:"London Borough of Newham";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7855;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15300";s:6:"answer";s:66:"For adult males is 130-170 g/L, and 120-150 g/L for adult females.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7856;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15301";s:6:"answer";s:7:"8 hours";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7857;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15302";s:6:"answer";s:260:"cloudagent is considered a miscellaneous file so it could be anything from files/pics linked throu your dropbox which are unfortunately still cached on your phone or if you use Google Play Music, the large size might be from music that's pinned to your device.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7858;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15303";s:6:"answer";s:14:"Nicobar island";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7859;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15303";s:6:"answer";s:138:"The southernmost tip of the Great Nicobar island is the southernmost point of land in the territory of India. It is at 6 o 45' N latitude.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7860;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15304";s:6:"answer";s:277:"The Crisis Prevention Institute (CPI) offers courses designed to teach educators and caregivers techniques to diffuse potentially violent situations before they escalate. CPI certification is earned through completing classes that permit teaching intervention methods to peers.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7861;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15305";s:6:"answer";s:234:"Corticosteroids mimic the effects of hormones your body produces naturally in your adrenal glands, which sit on top of your kidneys. When prescribed in doses that exceed your body's usual levels, corticosteroids suppress inflammation.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7862;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15306";s:6:"answer";s:137:"A noisy heated angry dispute; also: noisy controversy. See altercation defined for English-language learners.earn More About ALTERCATION.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7863;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15307";s:6:"answer";s:101:"A panel of stores carries new product for a fee in specific number of stores and geographic location.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7864;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15308";s:6:"answer";s:125:"They are a family of at least 28 isomers of linoleic acid found mostly in the meat and dairy products derived from ruminants.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7865;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15309";s:6:"answer";s:111:"Banks, railroads, and other key economic institutions to make sure these institutions would remain in business.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7866;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15310";s:6:"answer";s:9:"2-3 weeks";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7867;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15311";s:6:"answer";s:16:"After 3-6 weeks.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7868;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15312";s:6:"answer";s:270:"1 Preheat grill to maximum temperature. 2 Rub both sides of the steaks with coarse kosher or sea salt and freshly ground pepper. 3 Place the steaks 3 to 5 inches from the flame to sear the outside and seal in the juices.4 Sear the steaks for 2 to 3 minutes on each side.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7869;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15313";s:6:"answer";s:100:"A spill kit is a collection of items, to be used in case of a spill, leak or other discharge of oil.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7870;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15314";s:6:"answer";s:102:"Nightly builds are good thing, they provide immediate feed back to developers if they broke the build.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7872;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15316";s:6:"answer";s:14:"Western Europe";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7873;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15317";s:6:"answer";s:90:"Filtrate-the product of filtration; a gas or liquid that has been passed through a filter.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7874;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15318";s:6:"answer";s:122:"An allergy to sunflower seeds or their derivatives which causes an immune system reaction when in contact and/or ingested.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7875;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15319";s:6:"answer";s:16:"120°F to 125°F";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7876;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15319";s:6:"answer";s:16:"120°F to 125°F";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7877;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15320";s:6:"answer";s:15:"1 day to 9 days";s:8:"category