d; however, the average lifespan of a free-roaming cat is less than 3 years, whereas the lifespan of an indoor cat averages 15 to 18 years.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7890;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15332";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7891;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15333";s:6:"answer";s:42:"Less than 50 grams of added sugar per day.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7892;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15334";s:6:"answer";s:6:"6 feet";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7893;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15335";s:6:"answer";s:16:"October 13, 2015";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7894;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15336";s:6:"answer";s:6:"$3,700";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7895;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15337";s:6:"answer";s:292:"Chloroplasts are organelles that are found in plant cells and other eukaryotic organisms that can undergo photosynthesis or produce their own food. Chloroplast function as the food producers of the cell and every green plant in the planet is working to convert the sun’s energy into sugars.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7897;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15339";s:6:"answer";s:153:"Because burning them releases a number of extremely harmful gases, such as carbon dioxide and monoxide, sulfur oxides, nitrogen oxides, and hydrocarbons.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7898;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15340";s:6:"answer";s:12:"2 to 3 hours";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7899;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15340";s:6:"answer";s:71:"A general inspection on a 3 bed 2 bath house will take about 3-4 hours.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7900;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15341";s:6:"answer";s:134:"Dairy products, liver, fish, and fortified cereals; the top sources of provitamin A include carrots, broccoli, cantaloupe, and squash.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:7901;a:4:{s:8:"question";