 banana palm native to the Philippines.Abaca fibre is three times stronger than cotton or silk, and a fabric made from 100% abaca can last for over 100 years.As a result, sinamay holds a very firm shape.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8339;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15758";s:6:"answer";s:164:"It is one of the most popular hat-making foundations in the world. It is woven from the processed stalks of the abaca tree, a banana palm native to the Philippines.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8340;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15759";s:6:"answer";s:22:"$2,500-$15,000 or more";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8341;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15760";s:6:"answer";s:21:"$10 to as much as $25";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8342;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15761";s:6:"answer";s:120:"A gas giant is a large planet composed mostly of gases, such as hydrogen and helium, with a relatively small rocky core.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8343;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15762";s:6:"answer";s:176:"The spine (backbone) is composed of 33 interlocking bones called vertebrae that are separated by soft, compressible discs and supported by many different ligaments and muscles.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8344;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15763";s:6:"answer";s:198:"Acetoin is used as a food flavoring (in baked goods) and a fragrance. It can be found in apples, butter, yogurt, asparagus, black currants, blackberry, wheat, broccoli, brussels sprouts, cantaloupe.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8345;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15764";s:6:"answer";s:95:"Grits are the biggest seller for Weisenberger, with white grits outselling yellow three to one.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8346;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15765";s:6:"answer";s:113:"Is a high-performance aftermarket tuning company which specializes in Mercedes-Benz, Smart, and Maybach vehicles.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"labe