";s:5:"label";N;}i:8362;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15781";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8363;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15782";s:6:"answer";s:148:"Located in central Dalmatia, in the county of Zadarska, Zadar (population 75,000) is 226km from Rijeka, 160km from Split and only 72km from Sibenik.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8364;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15783";s:6:"answer";s:14:"Eternia Region";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8365;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15784";s:6:"answer";s:393:"Prices usually start at around $6 per square foot up to $10 per square foot for a basic design without any colors or special designs.Adding colors or a pattern to the design can increase the price to $15 per square foot.he average price that homeowners pay for a concrete patio is around $2,800 to just over $4,000, but some homeowners report spending as little as $1,000 or as much as $6,500.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8366;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15784";s:6:"answer";s:33:"Around $2,800 to just over $4,000";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8367;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15785";s:6:"answer";s:87:"Attacks of muscle weakness or paralysis when the level of potassium in the blood drops.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8368;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15785";s:6:"answer";s:92:"Reduced levels of potassium in their blood (hypokalemia) during episodes of muscle weakness.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8369;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15786";s:6:"answer";s:43:"Between $16 and $20 per square foot Average";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8370;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15787";s:6:"answer";s:67:"Saison was the beer brewed by households for their own consumption.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8371;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15788";s:6:"answer";s:71:"It is a weak physical side bond that is easily broken by water or heat.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8372;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15789";s:6:"answer";s:99:"Squirrels can live up from 15-20 years in captivity but seldom live longer than a year in the wild.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8373;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15790";s:6:"answer";s:89:"A caucus is a meeting of supporters or members of a specific political party or movement.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8374;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15791";s:6:"answer";s:7:"8 years";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8375;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15791";s:6:"answer";s:129:"It is possible to become a pharmacist in as few as 6 years with an associate’s degree, but the more common timeline is 8 years.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8376;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15792";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8377;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15793";s:6:"answer";s:312:"Pseudoephedrine is a drug found in numerous prescription and behind-the-counter medications, including Sudanese Congestion (but not Sudafed PE), Zyrtec-D, and Claritin-D.It's used to temporarily relieve nasal congestion from colds, allergies, and hay fever, and temporarily relieve sinus congestion and pressure.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8378;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15793";s:6:"answer";s:195:"Pseudoephedrine is a sympathomimetic drug of the phenethylamine and amphetamine chemical classes. It may be used as a nasal/sinus decongestant, as a stimulant, or as a wakefulness-promoting agent";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8379;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15794";s:6:"answer";s:65:"The National Mall is a national park in downtown Washington, D.C.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8380;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15795";s:6:"answer";s:242:"Crustaceans may pass through a number of larval and immature stages between hatching from their eggs and reaching their adult form. Each of the stages is separated by a moult, in which the hard exoskeleton is shed to allow the animal to grow.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8381;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15796";s:6:"answer";s:48:"Pink, purple, orange, yellow, white and magenta.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8382;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15796";s:6:"answer";s:100:"Bougainvillea comes in a variety of colors like pink, purple, orange, yellow and white with magenta.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8383;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15797";s:6:"answer";s:150:"Sedimentary breccia is a type of clastic sedimentary rock which is made of angular to subangular, randomly oriented clasts of other sedimentary rocks.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8384;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15798";s:6:"answer";s:190:"To keep the license current, the CNA must contact the Texas Department of Aging and Disability Services, Licensing and Credentialing Regulatory Services every two years to verify employment.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8385;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15799";s:6:"answer";s:133:"It is a type of systemic scleroderma and an ongoing, progressive, autoimmune disease that attacks the connective tissues of the body.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8386;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15800";s:6:"answer";s:13:"North America";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8387;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15801";s:6:"answer";s:6:"Oxygen";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8388;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15802";s:6:"answer";s:199:"$5-$35 or more a foot for labor and materials, depending on height, type (galvanized or vinyl color coated), gauge and mesh size, or about $600-$4,000 for 100' and $2,000-$11,000 for 300' of fencing.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8389;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15803";s:6:"answer";s:44:"0.4 milliunits per liter (mU/L) to 4.0 mU/L.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8390;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"qu