tion rate and a factor that decreases the number of collisions between particles will decrease the chemical reaction rate.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8401;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15814";s:6:"answer";s:255:"Usually, an increase in temperature is accompanied by an increase in the reaction rate. Temperature is a measure of the kinetic energy of a system, so higher temperature implies higher average kinetic energy of molecules and more collisions per unit time.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8402;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15815";s:6:"answer";s:11:"300 gallons";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8403;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15816";s:6:"answer";s:12:"$621 in 1974";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8404;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15817";s:6:"answer";s:153:"1 mother plant, 12 immature plants, and 6 mature plants. I highly recommend having your medical marijuana recommendation or a copy of next to the plants.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8405;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15818";s:6:"answer";s:89:"SwapBabyGoods. SwapBabyGoods is a site that lets you trade in used baby clothes and gear.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8406;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15819";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8407;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15819";s:6:"answer";s:3:"Yes";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8408;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15819";s:6:"answer";s:2:"No";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8409;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_15820";s:6:"answer";s:370:"Insert the memory stick into an SD port on your computer or a memory card reader that's connected to the PC. Click the Windows orb and select Computer in the right pane of the Start menu. Double-click the SD memory stick in the Devices with Removable Storage section and then minimize the folder that opens.Step Right-click the folder or the photos you want to transfer.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";