 argumentum ad hominem, is an attack on an argument made by attacking the character, motive, or other attribute of the person making the argument, rather than attacking the argument directly.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8870;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_16240";s:6:"answer";s:318:"Count the number of QRS complexes in one continuous lead where cardiac activity was monitored for the whole 10 seconds or in contiguous leads encompassing 10 seconds of cardiac activity. Multiply this number by 6 (10 x 6 = 60 seconds = 1 minute) to obtain the number of heartbeats per minute or the average heart rate.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8871;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_16241";s:6:"answer";s:90:"An oligarchy is a society in which a small group of dictators is in charge of the country.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8872;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_16241";s:6:"answer";s:104:"An example of an oligarchy is a society in which a small group of dictators is in charge of the country.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8873;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_16242";s:6:"answer";s:115:"The term anorexia is of Greek origin: an - (ἀν-, prefix denoting negation) and orexis (ὄρεξις, appetite).";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8874;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_16243";s:6:"answer";s:13:"About 28 days";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8875;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_16244";s:6:"answer";s:246:"Place precooked chicken on a microwave-safe dish. Cover the dish with a paper towel to lock in moisture while reheating. Turn the microwave on its high setting and cook the chicken for two to three minutes until it reaches 165 degrees Fahrenheit.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:8876;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_16245";s:6:"answer";s:154:"Whereas a locked cell phone will only accept SIM cards from its current provider, an unlocked cell phone will accept a SIM card from any service provider.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"l