amily, which includes celery, celeriac, parsley, parsnips, and carrot.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9976;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17065";s:6:"answer";s:200:"A dry port (sometimes inland port) is an inland intermodal terminal directly connected by road or rail to a seaport and operating as a centre for the transshipment of sea cargo to inland destinations.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9977;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17066";s:6:"answer";s:39:"The most common silent reflux symptoms.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9978;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17067";s:6:"answer";s:10:"8-18 weeks";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9979;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17068";s:6:"answer";s:11:"1 volt amps";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9980;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17069";s:6:"answer";s:14:"3 or 4 yrs old";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9981;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17070";s:6:"answer";s:286:"A tostada is built on a deep-fried corn tortilla, but low-calorie tostada shells can also be baked or microwaved. The shell is used as a base for a small layered salad consisting of refried beans, guacamole, diced tomatoes, sliced olives, sour cream, shredded lettuce and grated cheese.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9982;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17071";s:6:"answer";s:5:"soil.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9983;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17072";s:6:"answer";s:53:"Legal issues, primarily on gaining women's suffrage .";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9984;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17073";s:6:"answer";s:45:"It is relating to the landscape of the earth.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9985;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17074";s:6:"answer";s:14:"Cardiac muscle";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9986;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17075";s:6:"answer";s:242:"Measles vaccine, mumps vaccine, rubella vaccine, Live attenuated influenza vaccine (the seasonal flu nasal spray and the 2009 H1N1 flu nasal spray), chicken pox vaccine, oral polio vaccine (Sabin), rotavirus vaccine, and yellow fever vaccine.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9987;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17076";s:6:"answer";s:2:"No";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9988;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17077";s:6:"answer";s:16:"0.76 cents / kWh";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9990;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17079";s:6:"answer";s:7:"Uranium";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9991;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17080";s:6:"answer";s:203:"CEO or chief executive officer is a bureaucratic position that carries the ultimate management responsibility for an organization. Commonly, CEO is a rank that is associated with the head of the company.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9992;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17081";s:6:"answer";s:109:"Slang for copy-pasta.Usually used by someone who has been around long enough to wear out the term copy-pasta.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9993;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17082";s:6:"answer";s:18:"25 inches per year";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9994;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17083";s:6:"answer";s:248:"Methyl salicylate topical (for the skin) is used for temporary relief of muscle or joint pain caused by strains, sprains, arthritis, bruising, or backaches.Methyl salicylate topical may also be used for purposes not listed in this medication guide.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9995;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17084";s:6:"answer";s:42:"Inflammation of the lining of the stomach.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9996;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17085";s:6:"answer";s:13:"3 to 6 weeks.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9997;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17086";s:6:"answer";s:11:"Motherboard";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9998;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17087";s:6:"answer";s:5:"Asia.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}i:9999;a:4:{s:8:"question";s:11:"query_17088";s:6:"answer";s:240:"Geodes are technically sedimentary rocks, since they are the result of the action of water. Geodes are formed when cavities in a host rock (which may be sedimentary or igneous) become lined with a durable mineral, often a variety of quartz.";s:8:"category";s:2:"qa";s:5:"label";N;}}